# rpmlint filters for sofka. Everything here is inherent to repackaging
# upstream's prebuilt, stripped Rust release binary rather than compiling
# from source, or a deliberate packaging choice.

# Upstream ships the binary already stripped; there is no separate debug
# info to extract, and no testsuite to run in the build root either.
addFilter(r"no-%check-section")

# NOTE: a local rpmlint (2.10, full Enchant dictionary + network-capable
# URL check) also flags invalid-url on the bare Source0/1 filenames and
# spelling-error on upstream's tagline / kube-rs / ratatui / openSUSE.
# Neither fires in OBS's actual build root (rpmlint 2.7, no spell
# dictionary installed, sandboxed/no network) - filtering them there is
# itself an rpmlint error (unused-rpmlintrc-filter), so they're
# deliberately left out here. Re-add if a future OBS/rpmlint upgrade
# starts producing them for real.
